Data Privacy Notice:

MailMate processes email data locally on your machine. Users are responsible
for ensuring compliance with applicable data protection regulations (GDPR, 
CCPA, etc.) when processing email data.

No email content is transmitted to third parties except when using AI APIs
(Groq, Gemini) for classification and summarization, subject to their 
respective privacy policies.
